me": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1021011425999827", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_1021011429333160_4176289926510597494_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_7cg5HtILBAQ7kNvwFiRiAr&_nc_oc=Adq-wYfSeAeVZwo-jcQUra5-6KpbGygZS-yLYRON6VaDTRQpOXe7DQBjys5nBTF4W9o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af15_416U1x1F4gpU9AUb6uaYJFxRl957tGdeAcXj8k_tw&oe=69F0D121"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 4.png", "id": "524012790104112", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001669_524012793437445_4891316513078544414_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JoN_S3V5l0MQ7kNvwGd2sBY&_nc_oc=AdrNvtJr0ftg9TmkGWbVfMIqChak3i_e17sRHIBW2bSq-rS4SDT_SEu0nIsQ8aWKC2c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1H69OYbH4GauD_Jhg4q-RnPT4F-UBYwplv-IV0P8pIZA&oe=69F0AD5A"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "1187574142495669", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031470_1187574145829002_8495108821353233334_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fFcdwcVzeswQ7kNvwHRTqf-&_nc_oc=AdqEDVXYwhYmmqSRhPV3dLJnC0qQGH93F-hPftwbRNDpZi_S26lZGqPhso_fFoJCS88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3W1-DUiW8C3hqEviWpSaFCAF0YijaG6CZfm82PRCmiug&oe=69F09FF0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "529809686395654", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476759_529809689728987_2021663405477506286_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eYeSYEC9OKIQ7kNvwGDlzPN&_nc_oc=Adr9dQ_afP45M3KUA6r7EFXH9vv3G4VNmT8BdGZa862TWdel2L1ts1kXwX3DiElS3mM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0aMm35b2jReAXSHKCpr3zQoQEG6d9yJ6jp-BJsSWiSBg&oe=69F0CA3F"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that allows you to explore cell structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape Mini.png", "id": "2930927027073306", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974477_2930927030406639_1033799740283778117_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oKvKjB0XWiEQ7kNvwHYdt53&_nc_oc=AdpYaPWDRHs07T-Qakd_NI08-5RZCuf3ud8WaTggXw_vM0AK